<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NEI Hold details capitalisation share award.</title>
<headline>NEI Hold details capitalisation share award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>NEI Africa Holdings Ltd said on Monday that capitalisation shares will be awarded to shareholders in the ratio that 24.64 cents holds to the weighed average price of NEI shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange for the four days ending May 15, discounted at five percent.</p>
<p>It said shareholders may decline the award and instead receive a final cash dividend of 24.64 cents a share.</p>
<p>To qualify for the award and dividend, shareholders needed to be registered in the company's books on April 18. Payment will be made on May 30.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
